  "description": "With a racing heart, Jinho makes his way to Room 609, where Yunsoo is waiting for him. Yunsoo, the dreamy, blond, green-eyed stud he’s had a crush on since forever. If he’s lucky, he'll get to kiss him. If he's really lucky, he'll get to blow him. And one day, he’ll get to go all the way... Deep down, Jinho knows being secret f-buddies isn’t what he truly wants. But what can he do to turn a crush into something more?\n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
